.TH MATE-REDSHIFT 1 "October 2026" "mate-redshift" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mate-redshift \- Night Light settings for the MATE desktop
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mate-redshift
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B mate-redshift
is a graphical Night Light configuration utility for the MATE desktop.
It configures and controls redshift-gtk, including color temperature,
schedule, location, brightness, autostart, and temporary suspension.
.SH OPTIONS
The application currently provides no mate-redshift-specific command-line options.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR redshift (1),
.BR redshift-gtk (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Written by Kerem Söke.
